      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The real predicament is the incomprehensibly unoptimized avatars that ruin your FPS, and (if you have ShowAvatar enabled for that avatar) there is no way of hiding the avatar, given you can't select the avatar nor can you hid the avatar via the performance settings.\nThe only way to fix the issue is (in VR) to look away from the laggy avatar (to un-render it) and take a blind shot by pointing your controller backwards in hopes that you select their avatar and not the dozens of others surrounding them so you can hide the avatar.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
