      "value": "I don't believe this applies to low FPS anymore. Even with high framerates, my ability to select people will just randomly cease to exist for a great deal of time. There is no way that I can manually cause or fix it. I'm at the mercy of some obscure bug. This often makes dealing with bad actors difficult, but worse-so, I may ask someone if I can clone their avatar or friend them, only to find that I can't even select them in the first place.",
